  ('e846610d-cecc-50c8-979c-093f8d996fdb', '5a74e8de-3083-5aab-a6d3-b8cb61ab7910', 'Army', 'enlisted', '13M', null, 'assignments', 'E-7', null, 'Sergeant First Class — Operational Authorization', 'Chapter 8. MOS 13M - Multiple Launch Rocket System (MLRS) / High Mobility Artillery Rocket', 'The Platoon Sergeant is the CD position at this grade. Operations Sergeant/Master Gunner, Intelligence Sergeant, Ammunition NCO and Operations NCO are the CLT positions at this grade. These authorizations develop an NCO’s direct leadership, technical, and tactical expertise through practical application. The focus at this level is on the operational unit, where SFC build on their foundational knowledge to become technical and tactical experts while improving their leadership abilities. Self Development: Sergeants First Class who proactively pursue continuous learning and development cultivate essential leadership skills and practical knowledge. Earning distinctions like the Expert Soldier Badge (ESB) and participation in competitive events such as NCO of the Quarter/Year demonstrate significant potential and a commitment to self-development. Functional training enhances both individual MOS proficiency and overall unit capabilities. While all Soldiers will not be able to attend all key training courses, they should prioritize courses that align with their unit METL and TOE requirements. Such courses consist of FA Master Gunner Course, Battle Staff NCO Course, Protection Cell Operations, Protection Integration Course (PIC), Jumpmaster School, Master Drivers Course, Jungle School, Arctic Soldier Course, Arctic Leaders Course, Air Assault School, Basic Airborne Course, Holistic Health and Fitness Integrator Course, Security Managers Course, TC-AIMS II, and Unit Movement Officer II, Tactical Combatives Course Level II. ACE/SI. Self-development opportunities that support individual educational objectives include correspondence courses, professional certifications, and civilian education.', 'f5fc834bad90fe89716275a33596e9c040103e6156e079c747394db3b2c7e5ec', 29, 30, null, 110, null, null, false, null),
